      <div style="position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#ff6b35;color:#000;font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Most Popular</div>
      <div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:#ff6b35;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:4px">Pro</div>
